    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"Stop moving altogether\"? What do you mean by that? I'm just standing here in the middle of the ruins, Kaelen. I feel like I'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. It's like the world just keeps spinning even though everything I cared about has stopped.",
